  "observations": [
    "All twelve printed mana costs agree with the recorded symbols.",
    "The scan white symbol is the original spiked sun without a background cost disc; baseline uses the modern sun and disc.",
    "The baseline is generally low; the five-symbol Force of Nature row is too narrow.",
    "The skull, tree, droplet, flame and generic numeral contours differ from the retained SVG assets. Position fitting cannot repair those contours. Colors and contrast vary across scans.",
    "No per-card offsets or whole-frame transforms are introduced. Alpha frame edges remain uncertain."
